Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:02.84,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The Pastry of Knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:07.17,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Tales have been told of this pastry as one \Nof the Seven Wonders of Eden College.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:10.93,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,A mysterious pâtissier appears \Nout of nowhere at their cafeteria
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.93,0:00:13.62,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and serves this pastry on a whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:16.05,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Not only is it exquisitely delicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.05,0:00:20.24,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,but many students who taste these \Npastries end up as Imperial Scholars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:24.24,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,So people started to say that eating \Nthem will instantly make you smarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:25.85,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,This caused some Eden students
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:29.33,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,to do everything they could for a \Nchance to order these pastries.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.97,0:02:03.97,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fscx41\pos(35,80)}The Pastry of Knowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:08.36,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, my! Could you be the \Nprince I met before?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:11.85,main,Anya,0,0,0,,No, I am but your clone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.85,0:02:15.48,main,Becky,0,0,0,,No, I'm absolutely sure of it!\N Those eyes! That hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.48,0:02:17.99,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Ah, my sweet prince! I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.27,0:02:22.09,main,Anya,0,0,0,,No, I am but a female sheep like yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.46,0:02:27.26,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, dang it! We're not getting any \Nfurther in this story! It's all a mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:29.76,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I mean, these look exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.76,0:02:32.13,main,Becky,0,0,0,,You can ignore that part \Nfor the sake of the story!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:36.55,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Next is Anya's turn. It'll be a battle \Nstory with twins separated at birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.55,0:02:40.38,main,Becky,0,0,0,,No! If we do anything with a battle, \Nthey'll get all torn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.38,0:02:41.40,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:42.90,main,Becky,0,0,0,,By the way, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:46.42,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Next term, we're going to be \Nsplit up depending on our grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.42,0:02:47.39,main,Anya,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:48.79,main,Becky,0,0,0,,It means...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:50.81,sign_4041_26_The_Smart_Class,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(398,1)}The Smart Class\N {\c&H3488DB&}The Okay Class
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:51.10,main,Becky,0,0,0,,There's me, who's okay at school...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.10,0:02:53.43,main,Becky,0,0,0,,And then there's you, \Nwho's terrible at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.56,0:02:57.65,sign_4041_26_The_Smart_Class,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H56CD79&}The Needs Effort Class\N{\c&HB87E34&} Below That
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.43,0:02:56.42,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Depending on how our lessons go, \Nwe could be separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:57.40,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.90,0:03:00.07,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya will be all alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.07,0:03:03.63,main,Becky,0,0,0,,You will! That's why you have to \Nwork harder on your studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.25,0:03:06.37,main,Becky,0,0,0,,On top of our midterms and finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:09.56,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I hear our quiz tomorrow will \Nalso be a determining factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.56,0:03:13.44,main,Becky,0,0,0,,So will our test on ancient language.\NUgh, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.44,0:03:15.34,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It's all over for Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.83,0:03:17.07,main,Student A,0,0,0,,Th-Th-Th-This is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:18.41,main,Student A,0,0,0,,It happened! It appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.41,0:03:19.71,main,Student B,0,0,0,,What? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.71,0:03:23.05,main,Student A,0,0,0,,It appeared in the second \Ncafeteria! {\i1}That{\i0} dessert!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.05,0:03:24.38,main,Student B,0,0,0,,Huh? What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:26.07,main,Student A,0,0,0,,You moron! You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.07,0:03:29.35,main,Student A,0,0,0,,The dessert made by the legendary \Npâtissier who used to be a royal chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:31.39,main,Student A,0,0,0,,It's known as the Pastry of Knowledge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.39,0:03:34.65,main,Student A,0,0,0,,The legendary dessert that's said \Nto make everyone who eats it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:36.11,main,Student A,0,0,0,,an Imperial Scholar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.17,0:03:39.07,main,Student A,0,0,0,,Apparently, they're macarons this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:42.42,main,Student A,0,0,0,,There's only a limited amount, so we \Ngotta get them before someone else does!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.75,0:03:42.83,top,Student B,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:51.83,main,Anya,0,0,0,,If I eat that, I'll be a genius, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.83,0:03:57.00,sign_5559_53___Please_don_t_r,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(128,295)\fsp.4}* Please don't run in the hallway
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.06,0:03:54.00,top,Becky,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm sure it's just a silly rumor,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:56.13,top,Becky,0,0,0,,but superstitions like \Nthis can be important, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.13,0:04:00.87,top,Becky,0,0,0,,Besides, macarons made by a royal chef? \NI'd want to eat them just for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.87,0:04:01.86,main,Becky,0,0,0,,They sound delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.86,0:04:02.75,main,Anya,0,0,0,,What's a macaron?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.53,0:04:06.51,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, that must be it! We need \Nto hurry, or they'll run out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:09.38,main,Becky and Damian,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.38,0:04:10.51,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Second Son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.51,0:04:11.87,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Shrimp!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:13.37,main,Becky,0,0,0,,What are you in such a hurry for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.37,0:04:15.14,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Shut up! Right back at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:18.83,main,Employee,0,0,0,,There's only one order left of \NPierre Pommier's new sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.49,0:04:21.19,main,Employee,0,0,0,,First come first served!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.19,0:04:23.19,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,You guys aren't going to get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.19,0:04:25.95,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,This battle is basically over Stellas!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:27.41,main,George,0,0,0,,I'd like this, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.41,0:04:28.51,main,Employee,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.06,0:04:33.09,main,Employee,0,0,0,,That's the last order of these for the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:37.23,main,George,0,0,0,,Wow, I got super lucky. \NI wonder if I can get a Stella now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.23,0:04:38.53,main,George,0,0,0,,I'm so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.95,0:04:39.10,main,Damian,0,0,0,,George...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.10,0:04:39.78,main,George,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:42.17,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Damn it! That's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.17,0:04:44.68,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Hand those over! I was \Nsupposed to eat those!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:46.83,main,George,0,0,0,,Wah! I'm being mugged!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.83,0:04:50.32,main,George,0,0,0,,I bought these with what little \Nmoney I have! You can't have them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:54.19,main,Damian,0,0,0,,That's right! You never \Ngave me back my pen case!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:54.82,main,George,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.82,0:04:57.85,main,Becky,0,0,0,,And you embarrassed me by making \Nme sing when I didn't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.85,0:04:59.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,That leaf will be avenged.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:01.19,main,George,0,0,0,,O-Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.19,0:05:04.69,main,George,0,0,0,,There are five of these, \Nso you can have the other four.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.69,0:05:06.56,main,George,0,0,0,,Then we'll be even.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.56,0:05:08.20,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hey, you're a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:10.16,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Four left...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.56,0:05:22.93,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.93,0:05:27.85,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,an epic battle to decide who would \Nbecome Imperial Scholars began.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.81,0:05:32.19,main,Damian,0,0,0,,We're gonna play a round of Old Maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:34.40,main,Damian,0,0,0,,The one who comes in last \Ndoesn't get a macaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:36.45,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Okay, bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.45,0:05:39.42,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's never played cards before \Nand doesn't know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:40.81,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.81,0:05:45.50,main,Becky,0,0,0,,It's simple. You just need to match \Nthe same numbers and avoid the joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:46.37,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Okee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.28,0:05:49.50,main,Damian; Ewen; Emile; Becky,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.80,0:05:53.30,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,Hey, give me the joker. We'll make \Nher take it and show her who's boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:54.47,italics,Emile,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.47,0:05:56.42,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,The Pastry of Knowledge \Nwould be wasted on
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.42,0:05:58.51,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,someone who doesn't even \Nknow what Old Maid is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:06.49,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hey, it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:10.40,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Anya has... a six, a four, a ten...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:12.52,main,Becky,0,0,0,,You don't need to tell them, Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.39,0:06:15.80,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,What a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.80,0:06:17.61,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,I'll make the joker easier to grab
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.61,0:06:20.48,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,and move the six farther \Naway so she won't grab it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:21.72,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Go on. Pick one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:26.97,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.31,0:06:28.34,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:32.14,main,Becky,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:34.27,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Th-That was just dumb luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.67,0:06:36.65,main,Aya,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.65,0:06:37.71,main,Aya,0,0,0,,Ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:38.68,main,Aya,0,0,0,,A!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:39.92,main,Aya,0,0,0,,Some old guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.18,0:06:43.67,main,Aya,0,0,0,,Yay! Anya doesn't have any more cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:46.29,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Now, hang on! You're way too good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.73,0:06:48.42,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Yeah! You obviously cheated!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:50.65,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,You must've marked the cards or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.65,0:06:52.93,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Whatever! Stop being bad sports!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.11,0:06:58.02,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,If she didn't cheat, the only answer \Nis that she can read minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:07:00.69,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I went too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:04.98,main,Anya,0,0,0,,If you insist, we can play again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.98,0:07:07.82,main,Becky,0,0,0,,What? You're going too easy on them, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:10.57,main,Damian,0,0,0,,We're starting all over again \Nwith a new set of cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.57,0:07:12.00,main,Damian,0,0,0,,We're changing our order, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:14.13,main,Damian,0,0,0,,And don't you dare cheat again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.13,0:07:15.25,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.68,0:07:18.25,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,That was close...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.25,0:07:23.32,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I need to mess up on purpose so they don't \Nfind out about my telepath powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:32.92,italics,Ewen,0,0,0,,Ooh, I got the joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.34,0:07:34.13,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.92,0:07:38.07,italics,Ewen,0,0,0,,The joker's in the middle. Now, grab it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.07,0:07:39.87,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I need to mess up on purpose...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.49,0:07:43.20,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh noes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:46.01,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya has clumsily grabbed Mister Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.84,0:07:47.99,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,How lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.99,0:07:50.06,main,Emile,0,0,0,,You dumb moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:52.66,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Now it's time for my killer...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.66,0:07:54.95,main,Becky,0,0,0,,No, Anya. You can't hit him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.24,0:07:57.90,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Luck's not on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.69,0:08:02.17,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,That was close. If I got expelled, \Nthe mission would've been over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.17,0:08:05.16,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I need to be a cool liar like Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.16,0:08:06.09,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.09,0:08:09.79,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya will be safe if the second \Nson grabs the Mister Joker next.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.79,0:08:10.62,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:28.90,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.90,0:08:30.76,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,She's so incredibly obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.58,0:08:33.31,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Welp, there's a pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.31,0:08:36.49,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Could it be that Second \NSon can read minds, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:40.71,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,And I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.45,0:08:43.21,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.43,0:08:46.37,italics,Aya,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I can't get rid of Mr. Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.37,0:08:48.20,main,Emile,0,0,0,,I'm done, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.21,0:08:53.74,main,George,0,0,0,,You're pretty bad at this, too, Damian.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.74,0:08:54.77,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.77,0:08:56.47,main,Becky,0,0,0,,You've got this, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.55,0:08:58.98,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.98,0:09:00.97,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,This will decide everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:04.22,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,No, if I just watch her face, \NI've got this in the bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.22,0:09:08.35,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I need to do my best lying face \Nso he'll grab Mister Joker!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:12.29,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,If I lose, I won't be able to eat \Nthat dessert and I'll stay dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.29,0:09:16.31,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Then I'll do bad on my tests and be \Nin different classes than Becky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.74,0:09:19.51,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya will be all alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:22.34,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,Okay, this one must be the \None that's not the joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.89,0:09:46.61,main,George,0,0,0,,Okay, here you go, you four.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:49.39,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Yay! It looks so yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.39,0:09:50.54,main,Anya,0,0,0,,So exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:54.17,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Lord Damian, how could you \Npossibly pick the joker there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.17,0:09:55.40,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:58.24,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,She's so unfair... Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.04,0:10:02.16,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Second Son.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.45,0:10:09.41,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Want to split it with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.64,0:10:14.79,main,Damian,0,0,0,,N-N-N-N-No, I don't, you dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.79,0:10:18.31,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I can become an Imperial Scholar \Neven if I don't eat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:20.61,main,Damian,0,0,0,,You eat it because you're stupid, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.06,0:10:22.16,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Grr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.16,0:10:26.15,main,Becky,0,0,0,,My, how rude! Let's just eat them now, Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.55,0:10:28.24,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.59,0:10:32.90,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:34.58,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Now I'll be able to get a Stella, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:10:58.79,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Now, begin your quiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:14.91,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Confirmed: Anya is going to be all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.91,0:11:17.46,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The rest of my school life \Nis going to be dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:20.09,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Th-That's not true. \NLet's do our best on the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.09,0:11:23.61,main,George,0,0,0,,Yeah. You're still better off \Nthan me, since I'm already a loner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:29.05,main,Yor,0,0,0,,School tests are so difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.05,0:11:32.09,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya is going to go sulk in bed for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.18,0:11:40.21,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Her basic academics have improved a little, \Nbut she's still got a ways to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:43.38,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This test on ancient language...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.38,0:11:45.64,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,She was docked points for \Nconstant spelling errors,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:48.39,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,but without that, she would've \Ngotten quite the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.39,0:11:51.09,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,She hasn't studied ancient \Nlanguage that much yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.09,0:11:53.60,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Did she learn it wherever she grew up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:56.89,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But there aren't really any countries \Nthat still use this ancient language.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.49,0:12:01.91,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No... There's no point in \Nwondering about this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.91,0:12:05.60,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, Anya. I made you \NHamburg steak for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:07.24,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hamburg steak!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.24,0:12:09.86,main,Yor,0,0,0,,And I tried making some dessert!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.86,0:12:11.48,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Bworf?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.57,0:12:19.20,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Here's a fake ID to get into \NDoust Industries' 2nd Section.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.20,0:12:22.38,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Here are the test numbers for the \Nengine test on their new fighter jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:25.39,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx52\pos(335,285)}The Informant's Great Romance Plan II
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.27,0:12:24.88,top,Loid,0,0,0,,Thanks, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:27.64,main,Franky,0,0,0,,That's not for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:30.89,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What about the visual data on \Nthe members of that one group?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.89,0:12:33.53,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. About that... \NYou'll have to wait a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.53,0:12:36.81,main,Franky,0,0,0,,One of my contacts who knew \Na lot about them was offed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.43,0:12:38.44,main,Loid,0,0,0,,The State Security Service?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.44,0:12:43.37,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Nah. I'm not positive, but there \Nare rumors that Garden got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:44.69,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Garden?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.10,0:12:48.91,main,Loid,0,0,0,,The group of assassins who have \Nbeen in this country for ages?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.91,0:12:51.21,main,Loid,0,0,0,,They're basically urban legends, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.21,0:12:53.99,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Nah, they definitely exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.99,0:12:58.00,main,Franky,0,0,0,,They eliminate one traitor after another\Non the shadow government's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:13:02.26,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I mean... I'm sure there's at \Nleast one authorized militia here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.26,0:13:05.21,main,Franky,0,0,0,,You dumbass! They're way \Nmore serious than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.21,0:13:09.02,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Just one of their soldiers \Ncan take down a whole squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:11.40,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous. I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:16.27,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Wait! Help me out with one of my jobs \Nin exchange for this extra labor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.27,0:13:17.51,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Job?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.89,0:13:20.05,main,Franky,0,0,0,,This guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:24.32,sign_19167_227_Missing,Sign,0,0,0,,LOST CAT
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.05,0:13:21.46,main,Loid,0,0,0,,A lost cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.46,0:13:25.01,main,Franky,0,0,0,,This is Kopi. He belongs to a girl named Kacey, \Nwho works at a café where I'm a regular.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:30.31,main,Franky,0,0,0,,He went missing last week, \Nand Kacey was super sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.65,0:13:31.89,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Twilight...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:34.04,main,Franky,0,0,0,,So that Kacey can smile again—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:37.26,main,Franky,0,0,0,,and while we're at it, so that \NKacey and I can get closer—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.26,0:13:39.46,main,Franky,0,0,0,,help me get this cat back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.92,0:13:40.93,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.93,0:13:41.93,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.93,0:13:44.54,main,Franky,0,0,0,,If you don't help me, I won't \Ngive you any more information!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.54,0:13:46.09,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:50.43,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I'll even throw in this brand-new \Npistol shaped like a toothbrush!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.74,0:13:53.70,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Damn it! He's such a heartless jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.70,0:13:56.74,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Fine, then! I'll get the cat back on my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.11,0:13:59.63,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Don't go underestimating \Nan informant, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.26,0:14:01.89,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Hello? Jeffrey?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.31,0:14:04.19,main,Franky,0,0,0,,That's right. I've got a job for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:05.94,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.94,0:14:08.99,main,Franky,0,0,0,,He's a male Nortblue, and he's \Ngot a bell around his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.99,0:14:11.54,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Let me know if you find him. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.20,0:14:14.63,main,Franky,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Hound Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.63,0:14:16.73,main,Franky,0,0,0,,You're the best guy I know for this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:18.29,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Heya, Terrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.82,0:14:20.58,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Yup, this is an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.58,0:14:23.64,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Hey, Nancy. You know a lot \Nabout cats, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.64,0:14:26.38,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I'd like to talk to Harrison \Nat the 22nd Branch Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:28.01,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Hello, Mister Jasper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.01,0:14:29.00,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Yo, Pat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.72,0:14:36.15,italics,Joe,0,0,0,,I saw a cat matching that description \Non Ritter Street near city hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.15,0:14:37.96,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Excellent work, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.24,0:14:45.84,main,Franky,0,0,0,,He should be around here somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.84,0:14:47.66,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh? Franky?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.29,0:14:50.52,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Yor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.52,0:14:51.76,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.76,0:14:52.92,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.76,0:14:56.27,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, you work at city hall, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:14:58.96,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm about to take my lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:01.67,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Do you work near here as well, Franky?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.67,0:15:03.79,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Er, no. Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.62,0:15:08.88,main,Yor,0,0,0,,There's a missing kitty?! Oh, my goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.88,0:15:10.63,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'd love to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.97,0:15:13.74,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, but you're about \Nto have lunch, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.74,0:15:15.01,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.01,0:15:18.89,main,Yor,0,0,0,,My s-spouse... er, husband's \Nfriend is in need, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.24,0:15:22.78,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,She's still keeping this husband \Nand wife act up all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:26.75,main,Yor,0,0,0,,A-As long as I won't cause you any trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.75,0:15:28.91,main,Franky,0,0,0,,In that case... Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.91,0:15:29.69,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.53,0:15:32.93,main,Yor,0,0,0,,So where is Mister Kopi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.93,0:15:35.53,main,Franky,0,0,0,,We know for a fact that \Nhe's around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.95,0:15:41.33,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I've placed several of my cat-shaped \Nwiretaps, C20s, at various cat spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:43.46,main,Franky,0,0,0,,They have a sensor that's supposed to react
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:46.10,main,Franky,0,0,0,,to the sound of the bell around Kopi's neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:49.78,main,Yor,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.34,0:15:51.69,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:57.89,main,Franky,0,0,0,,The C20 at Point A is being attacked?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.89,0:15:58.64,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.95,0:16:01.67,main,Franky,0,0,0,,It got destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.49,0:16:04.29,main,Franky,0,0,0,,How about the other points?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:10.51,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I guess they were eliminated \Nfor being outsiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.51,0:16:12.58,main,Franky,0,0,0,,So much for that plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.58,0:16:15.48,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I guess the world of kitties is also cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:18.66,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Then we'll just have to have him come to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.12,0:16:21.85,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Time for the CAT-N.I.P decoy system!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.85,0:16:23.57,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:29.23,main,Franky,0,0,0,,We're gonna get the target to come to \Nus by spreading the smell of catnip!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.23,0:16:32.68,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Wow, you're just so talented, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:34.31,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Are you a craftsman?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.31,0:16:37.47,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm just a young man who \Ndreams of making the world
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.47,0:16:39.99,main,Franky,0,0,0,,a better place with the inventions I create,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.99,0:16:41.85,main,Franky,0,0,0,,and also getting rich off of patents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.85,0:16:43.31,main,Yor,0,0,0,,My, that's lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:46.34,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,I can't tell her that I actually \Ndo pretty shady work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.56,0:17:01.08,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.08,0:17:06.30,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Oh, shit! Too many of them showed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:08.47,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Which one is Mister Kopi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.88,0:17:14.32,main,Franky,0,0,0,,There! The gray one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.32,0:17:15.88,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?! Which one is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.39,0:17:21.31,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Damn it! I'm gonna catch you, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.18,0:17:22.60,top,Yor,0,0,0,,Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:26.48,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Hyper Long Hand! Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.41,0:17:32.49,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Damn it, this isn't gonna work! \NI need to be more direct!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.49,0:17:33.86,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Hey, get outta there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.86,0:17:36.28,main,Franky,0,0,0,,My camera-shaped net launcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.75,0:17:39.42,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Kopi is definitely on his guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:43.54,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I'll have to carefully approach him \Nlike I'm just gonna take a picture...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:46.23,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,But because I made this \Nlauncher look like a camera,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.23,0:17:48.55,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,the range on it is super short.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.55,0:17:51.38,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,I need to get within two meters \Nto make sure it catches him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:10.52,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Come back here, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.85,0:18:10.53,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, that must be Mister Kopi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.95,0:18:21.86,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Oh, Kopi. Now you've made me mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.86,0:18:24.29,main,Franky,0,0,0,,It's too late to regret your actions now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.96,0:18:35.75,main,Franky,0,0,0,,This is the ultimate weapon \Nthat I spent ten years developing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.02,0:18:39.39,main,Franky,0,0,0,,This should give me \Nsuperhuman powers! Allegedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:41.52,top,Franky,0,0,0,,The Exo-Skeleton Power Suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.85,0:18:43.88,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Just you wait! After I turn it on,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.88,0:18:47.04,main,Franky,0,0,0,,it takes 15 minutes for the \Nmotor to get warmed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:48.46,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Just stay right there until then!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.67,0:18:54.89,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Hey! You dummy! That's a major \Nstreet over there! It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.31,0:18:58.25,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Stop! I'm sorry! I won't \Nchase you around anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.25,0:19:01.97,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Franky, I'm going to borrow this for a sec...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.33,0:19:10.08,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hi-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:11.62,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hi-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.37,0:19:28.76,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I caught him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:33.33,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I caught him, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:35.76,main,Franky,0,0,0,,U-Uh... Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.28,0:19:38.77,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Ten years... Ten years of my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.77,0:19:40.56,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Isn't this wonderful, Mister Kopi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.56,0:19:42.37,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You get to go home now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.59,0:19:48.40,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,But then again...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:52.54,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,It's a small price to pay if it \Ngets Kacey to look my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:55.16,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,Wait for me, my honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:58.55,sign_28629_342_USUAL_CAF__,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscy125}USUAL CAFÉ
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:58.54,main,Kacey,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:20:01.98,main,Kacey,0,0,0,,Oh, Kopi! I was just so worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.43,0:20:05.69,main,Mark,0,0,0,,That's great, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.80,0:20:11.36,main,Kacey,0,0,0,,Darn it, Mark! This wouldn't have happened \Nif you hadn't left the front door open!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.36,0:20:13.00,main,Mark,0,0,0,,Look, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:16.10,main,Mark,0,0,0,,I'll buy those matching \Nrings you've been wanting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.59,0:20:19.04,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah. This is great, yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.95,0:20:21.83,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.95,0:20:27.37,main,Kacey,0,0,0,,Seriously, thank you so much, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.69,0:20:32.23,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Well... Live happily ever after, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.49,0:20:45.33,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,That man decided to live for his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.82,0:20:52.85,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Helping others always feels so wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.78,0:20:56.63,main,Camilla,0,0,0,,You seem happy, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.63,0:21:00.67,main,Millie,0,0,0,,Ooh, why's that? Did your \Nhubby buy you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.67,0:21:02.54,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.77,0:21:05.32,main,Camilla,0,0,0,,Congrats on your happy marriage or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.32,0:21:07.08,main,Millie,0,0,0,,God, you piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.08,0:21:09.91,main,Sharon,0,0,0,,She just finally learned how \Nto be normal, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.70,0:21:11.90,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Normal...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.24,0:21:14.15,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Am I normal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.15,0:21:15.06,main,Camilla,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.40,0:21:16.93,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.93,0:21:19.31,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm glad I can pull off this act.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.31,0:21:22.73,main,Camilla,0,0,0,,Hey, Sharon. Don't let her get too cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.73,0:21:25.15,main,Sharon,0,0,0,,Er... I meant that as sarcasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:28.44,main,Section Chief,0,0,0,,Hey, Briar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.44,0:21:32.11,main,Section Chief,0,0,0,,Or rather, Forger. You've got a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.11,0:21:34.66,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! I am indeed Forger!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.61,0:21:41.96,main,Section Chief,0,0,0,,It's from your usual client.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.34,0:21:50.59,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.79,0:21:53.12,italics,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.91,0:21:57.52,italics,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,You've got a customer, Thorn Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:18.04,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The bright crimson that \Nappears right before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:27.94,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stretches approximately 40,000 kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:35.79,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our wounds that inch closer behind us
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:40.87,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Make us wander even more \Nwhen we're already lost
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.87,0:22:45.46,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The unseeable, scentless, unmistakable future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.46,0:22:47.39,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stabbed me in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:48.55,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:58.09,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Let me stay by your side tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.09,0:23:05.81,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Just for tonight, I'm going to be serious
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.10,0:23:09.68,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Come closer to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.68,0:23:11.97,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Even the future we prayed for
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.97,0:23:14.00,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Has a different path
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:17.54,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,My dear
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.09,0:23:21.60,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our malice for each other
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.60,0:23:24.88,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Might just get to us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.25,0:23:29.48,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Or maybe not
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:40.01,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx37\pos(488,285)}Plan to Cross the Border
